### TITLE ###
PastedNewlinesAreContentNotSubmits
### DESCRIPTION ###
Between the terminal's paste markers, Enter inserts a line rather than
submitting. Without this, pasting any multi-line snippet runs its first line
and scatters the rest. Note this case sets no policy: Enter would otherwise
submit immediately.
### PROMPT ###
>
### CONT_PROMPT ###
.
### KEYS ###
paste-start
"a"
enter
"b"
paste-end
enter
### VALUE ###
a
b
### OUTCOME ###
submitted
### FRAMES ###
